{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nMUJI又有新零食啦！今次是牛扒脆系列，一共有4口味：鹽味、黑松露味、番茄味、香辣味。選用澳洲穀飼安格斯牛肉原切製成，片片酥脆，保留濃郁肉香。記者試吃後，覺得牛味濃，感覺像豬肉紙！當作香口零食也不錯，送酒應該是最佳拍檔！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932896413749647_17980244196ae36da99b54d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932896413749647_17980244196ae36da99b54d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964304560729_20216840676ae36dab3f8c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964304560729_20216840676ae36dab3f8c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964452952641_4861187726ae36dacb7994.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964452952641_4861187726ae36dacb7994.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964611775563_11472476386ae36dae57bcd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964611775563_11472476386ae36dae57bcd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964779354783_7684010126ae36db0077d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964779354783_7684010126ae36db0077d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964961623199_15654114606ae36db1c5edf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328964961623199_15654114606ae36db1c5edf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部、官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfFK_3XicZM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:21.837497+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T16:00:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:27:37.344378+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:30.412933+00:00","content_hash":"a62a76a3be12f06f7a683843f8fc9a5327656108f26a116f3c39be1c33139e58","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}